      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下載 %@ · 在這支手機上佔用 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download the verification files?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要下載驗證檔案嗎？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloaded and installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已下載並安裝"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloaded files stay on this phone, and a partly finished download is kept for next time. Unpacking starts over.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已下載完成的檔案會留在這支手機上，下載到一半的進度也會保留給下次使用。解壓縮會重新開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During an emergency": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "緊急時期"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each one counts once. If your last attempt ended without an answer, that attempt very likely counted — signing again would add a second signature.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一個只算一次。如果你上一次送出後沒收到回覆，那一次很可能已經算進去了——再簽一次會多一筆簽名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each one counts once. Nothing of yours was published.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一個只算一次。你的沒有被公開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erase": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erase all local data": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刪除所有本機資料"
          }
        }
