          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Issued by a government body through 數位憑證皮夾, and collected over the network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由政府機關透過數位憑證皮夾發行，領卡走網路。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Issuer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "發證單位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Issuer's signature": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "發卡者簽章"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Issuing authority certificate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "簽發機關憑證"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It carries a number unique to this card that every checker sees, whichever fields you withhold.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它帶著一個這張卡專屬的編號，不論你扣住哪些欄位，每一個查驗方都看得到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It carries no national ID number, because the certificate does not contain one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它不帶身分證統一編號，因為那張憑證裡本來就沒有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It carries your national ID number, but that is a field you can switch off each time you show it — switched off, the checker sees only a commitment they cannot open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它帶著你的身分證統一編號，但那是一個你每次出示都可以關掉的欄位；關掉之後查驗方只會看到一個打不開的承諾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It claims to have been made %@ from now, so this phone cannot tell how old it really is. One of the two clocks is wrong.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它宣稱的產生時間比現在還晚 %@，因此這支手機無法判斷它究竟多舊。兩支裝置其中一支的時間不準。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It contained characters that can rearrange text on screen; they are shown as �.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其中含有能把畫面文字重新排列的字元，已用 � 標示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It does not say how carefully your identity was checked. A card issued after a counter check and one issued from a web form look the same.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它不說你的身分被查得多仔細。臨櫃驗過證件才發的卡，跟在網頁上填一填就發的卡，長得一模一樣。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It has no credentials for the digital certificate service, so nothing was asked for and nothing was sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它沒有憑證服務的憑據，所以沒有向你索取任何東西，也沒有送出任何東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is %@, which is far larger than a real proof. It was not sent, so the one-time number is still good.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它有 %@，比真正的證明大得多。它沒有被送出去，所以一次性號碼還可以用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is listed on this phone but could not be opened.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它列在這支手機上，但打不開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is stored on this phone and was read correctly. There is no screen for its contents yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它存在這支手機上，也讀得正確。只是還沒有顯示內容的畫面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may have expired, or the wall may have changed its keys. Either way, starting again means making a new proof and signing again in 行動自然人憑證.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可能是它過期了，也可能是牆那邊換過金鑰。不論哪一種，重新開始就要做一份新的證明，也要再在行動自然人憑證裡簽一次名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It resets at 08:00 Taipei time. Nothing was used up, so the same proof can go again while the one-time number is still valid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "台灣時間早上八點重置。沒有東西被用掉，在一次性號碼還有效之前，同一份證明可以再送一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was made %@ ago. A code taped to a wall or kept in a photograph looks exactly like a checker standing in front of you. Ask them to show a new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它是在 %@ 前產生的。貼在牆上或存在相簿裡的條碼，看起來和眼前有人查驗一模一樣。請對方重新產生一個。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep going": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "繼續"
          }
        }
      }
    },
