        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未排除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not measured yet — download your ID once and come back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "還沒量過——先跑一次身分證下載，再回來看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not shown. Whether this card was cancelled can only be known online, and the list that would say so is vouched for by nothing this phone can check offline. A signed card is not the same as one that is still valid.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法顯示。這張卡片是否已被撤銷只能連線才會知道,而載明撤銷與否的清單,沒有任何這支手機能離線查證的東西為它背書。已簽章的卡片,不等於仍然有效的卡片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not started": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未開始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未支援"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is selected to begin with. Whatever you leave off is not sent — the checker sees only that some fields were held back, not what they were.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "預設一項都不給。沒有勾的欄位不會送出——查驗方只會看到「有幾項被保留」，看不到那些是什麼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is sent anywhere. This check works with the phone in aeroplane mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不會向外傳送任何資料。開飛航模式也能完成這次查驗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing left over": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有殘留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing stored from MyData yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MyData 目前沒有存放資料"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing stored here": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目前沒有存放資料"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing ties this proof to the person checking it, so it could be shown again elsewhere.": {
      "comment": "Limitation attached to a zero-knowledge proof",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個證明沒有綁定眼前的查驗方，可能被拿到別處再次出示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing was checked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有東西被查驗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing was published.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有任何東西被公開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing was sent and nothing on this phone changed. Either this version has the wrong address, or this network cannot look the name up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "什麼都沒有送出去，這支手機上也沒有任何改變。可能是這個版本的位址設錯了，也可能是這個網路查不到那個名稱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing was used up — the same proof can go again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有東西被用掉——同一份證明可以再送一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing was used up — the same proof can go again. The wall counts by network address, so other people on the same Wi-Fi count towards it too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒有東西被用掉——同一份證明可以再送一次。這面牆是按網路位址計算的，所以同一個 Wi-Fi 上的其他人也算在裡面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline check": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "離線出示與查驗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline there is no shared record of what has been used, so two checkers who never speak cannot both refuse the same person.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "離線的時候沒有一份共用的紀錄可以查誰用過，所以兩個彼此不通訊的查驗方，沒辦法一起擋下同一個人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A matching credential was found, but it does not contain the requested “%@” field, so it cannot be presented.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找得到相符的證件，但缺少查驗方要求的「%1$@」欄位，因此無法出示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One of the two devices has the wrong time. Check that both have date and time set automatically, then show it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩支裝置其中一支的時間不準。請兩邊都確認「日期與時間」設為自動，再出示一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Online": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "線上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the fields you switch on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有你打開的那些欄位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the fields you switch on. The rest stay as salted commitments the checker cannot open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有你打開的那些欄位。其餘的維持成加了鹽的承諾，查驗方打不開。"
          }
        }
      }
