            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃查驗方的 QR，自己決定給哪些欄位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan someone's document to check it is genuine — no network needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃描對方的證件，確認真偽——不需連網。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan the checker's code": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃描查驗方的碼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan the checker's code and %@ goes straight to their phone — about twenty seconds. Nothing is stored anywhere else.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃描查驗方的碼，%@ 直接送到對方手機——大約二十秒。不會留在任何其他地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan their document": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃描對方的證件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scanning this only tells the other phone where to send the proof. It is not a one-time number — the proof was made before you asked for it, so nothing here stops the same proof being sent again later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掃這個碼只是告訴對方的手機要把證明送到哪裡。它不是一次性亂數——那份證明在你要求之前就已經產生好了，所以沒有任何機制阻止同一份證明日後再被送一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sealed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已封存"
          }
        }
