    "This proof passed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份證明通過了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proof was made by a newer version of the app. Update this app, then check it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份證明是較新版本的 App 產生的。請先更新這個 App，再查驗一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proof was refused": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份證明被拒絕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This proves who issued the certificate, not that it is still valid today.": {
      "comment": "Limitation attached to a zero-knowledge proof",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這只證明憑證由誰簽發，不證明它今天仍然有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This request could not be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取這個查驗請求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This request points to an address the app does not trust, so nothing was presented.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個要求指向 app 不信任的位址，所以沒有出示任何資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This takes a while and uses a lot of memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這一步要花一段時間，而且很吃記憶體。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This takes about fifteen seconds and runs entirely on this phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大約需要十五秒，全程在這支手機上跑，不連任何伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version cannot create a document": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本無法建立證件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version cannot create a document.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本無法建立證件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version cannot create a proof: it has no credentials for the digital certificate service. Nothing will be asked for.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本無法產生證明：它沒有憑證服務的憑據。因此不會向你索取任何東西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version cannot download the files needed to check a proof, so a proof sent here cannot be checked. Say so before they send one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本無法下載查驗證明所需的檔案，所以送到這裡的證明查不了。請在對方送出之前先告訴他。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version cannot find the wall.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本找不到那面牆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version cannot make a proof.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本無法產生證明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version cannot open this card": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本還打不開這張卡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version cannot sign documents yet. Signing has to go through the bonds-tw service, which is not available in this build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本還不能簽署證件。簽署要經過 bonds-tw 的服務，而這個版本連不上它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version has no way to collect or show this card. What it describes is the card as the government issues it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個版本沒有領取或出示這張卡的功能。上面寫的是政府發出來的那張卡本身。"
          }
