    "This wording was written by the checker. This app cannot confirm who they are.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這段文字是查驗方自己填的。本 App 無法確認對方的身分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three kinds of document, three different trust models. Each one gives something up, and it is not the same something — which is only visible with all three on one screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三種文件，三種不同的信任模型。每一種都放棄了一些東西，而且放棄的不是同一樣——那件事只有在三張並排的時候看得見。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three things someone might ask this app to prove, and what it can do today. Two of the three come with an important limit — open each card's details to see exactly what.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有人可能會要求這個 App 證明的三件事，以及它今天能做到什麼。其中兩件附帶一項重要限制——展開每張卡的細節就能看到是什麼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
