          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等你在行動自然人憑證上簽名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We do not know whether this was published.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我們不知道這一筆有沒有被公開。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What a checker can rely on, and what none of them can establish.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗方可以倚賴什麼，以及哪一張都建立不了什麼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What a checker can rely on:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗方可以倚賴的："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What arrived was not a proof this app can read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收到的東西不是這個 App 讀得懂的證明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What can be confirmed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可以確認的部分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What each card is worth": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一張卡值多少"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What each of these cards is worth": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一張卡值多少"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What every checker learns": {
      "comment": "Caveat group subtitle",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個查驗方都會知道的事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it can show": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它能證明的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it cannot establish:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
