        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "對方出示了什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this app can prove": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個 App 能證明什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this check did not establish": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這次查驗沒有確認的事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this does": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個功能做什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this does not establish:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份證明沒有證明的事："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this kind of card proves": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這種卡證明得了什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this means": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這代表什麼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What would have to change": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要改變什麼才做得到"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you leave off is never sent. The verifier can still check that the rest was issued by the official issuer and not changed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你關掉的欄位不會被送出。查驗方仍能確認其餘欄位是官方發行、未被竄改的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether it has been cancelled can only be known online, and the list that says so is vouched for by nothing this phone can check offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它有沒有被註銷只有連上網才知道，而說明這件事的那份清單，沒有任何這支手機離線查得動的東西替它背書。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether it was cancelled": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "是否已被撤銷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether this document has been revoked cannot be checked offline.": {
      "comment": "Shown alongside a successful offline verification",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "離線狀態無法確認這份證件是否已被撤銷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which carrier?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "哪一家電信業者？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who signed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "誰簽署的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whoever runs the wall has turned it off. Nothing was sent, and trying again now gets the same answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "經營這面牆的人把它關掉了。什麼都沒有送出去，現在再試一次也會得到同樣的答案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "進行中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have not backed up your national ID yet. Build it from your MyData record — the control below starts it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你還沒有備份國民身分證。用你的 MyData 戶籍資料建立一份——下方的按鈕可以開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You will use TW FiDO to retrieve your National ID data, and create a valid document.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你將使用行動自然人憑證，從MyData取得自己的數位身分資料，建立一張正式證件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll be asked to approve this in the 行動自然人憑證 app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "過程中會請你到行動自然人憑證 App 完成核可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your ID number": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的身分證統一編號"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your certificate signs these details, which is what lets anyone checking them see that you are the one making the claim.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由你的憑證簽署這些欄位，查驗的人才看得出來，是你本人在主張這些內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your citizen certificate couldn't be read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取你的自然人憑證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your citizen certificate doesn't match the signature of MOICA G3.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的自然人憑證通不過內政部憑證管理中心第三代（G3）的簽章驗證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your citizen certificate expired on %@. Renew it before generating a proof.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的自然人憑證已於 %@ 到期，請更新後再產生證明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your citizen certificate isn't valid until %@. Check your device's date and time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的自然人憑證要到 %@ 才生效，請檢查裝置的日期與時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your citizen certificate was issued by %@, which this version can't prove. Only certificates from MOICA G3 are supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的自然人憑證由%@簽發，這一版還無法為它產生證明；目前只支援內政部憑證管理中心第三代（G3）簽發的憑證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your credentials, the source documents, and your device key will be deleted. The next document you create will use a new identifier and cannot be linked to the current one. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的憑證、原始文件與裝置金鑰都會被刪除。之後重新建立的證件會使用全新的識別碼，無法與目前這一個連結起來。此動作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your document could be readable from a copy of the device's storage.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有人拿到這支手機的儲存內容副本時，可能讀得到你的證件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your documents are encrypted at rest": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的證件在裝置上是加密的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your documents stay off iCloud": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的證件不會進 iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your household record is fetched through MyData only to build your national ID, then erased — nothing is kept here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的戶籍資料只透過 MyData 取得、用來建立國民身分證，之後即刪除——這裡不會保存任何資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your identity documents would be copied into every iCloud backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的身分證件會被複製進每一次 iCloud 備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name is always visible. It is written inside the certificate that signs the document, and the checker needs that certificate to check the signature — so no switch can withhold it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "姓名一定看得到。它寫在替這份證件簽章的憑證裡，而查驗方需要那張憑證才驗得了簽章——所以沒有任何開關扣得住它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name is written into the certificate that signs this document, and the checker needs that certificate to check the signature.": {
      "comment": "Why the name row has no switch",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "姓名寫在替這份證件簽章的憑證裡，而查驗方需要那張憑證才能驗簽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own backed-up ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你自己備份的身分證"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own digital certificate. That shows you are the one making these claims — not that the government has confirmed them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你自己的自然人憑證。這證明的是「這些主張出自你本人」，不是政府已經確認過這些內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your proof was not checked and nothing was published. The one-time number is gone, so trying again means making a new proof — including signing again in 行動自然人憑證.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的證明沒有被檢查，也沒有任何東西被公開。一次性號碼已經用掉了，所以再試一次就要重做一份證明——包括再在行動自然人憑證裡簽一次名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your signature may have gone through, but the result could not be fetched. Check this device's connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的簽章可能已經完成，但結果拿不回來。請確認這支手機的網路，再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your signing key is in hardware": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的簽署金鑰放在硬體裡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your wallet has no credential of the kind this verifier asked for.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的皮夾裡沒有查驗方要的那種證件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zero-knowledge proof": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "零知識證明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not reported": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未回報"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "with Taiwan's official MyData service": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透過台灣官方MyData服務"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "內政部 already knows your ID number asked for a signature for this app, and when. The wall publishes the minute each signature was made. Those two lists can be lined up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "內政部已經知道你的身分證統一編號在什麼時候為這支 App 要過一次簽章。這面牆會公開每一筆簽名發生在哪一分鐘。這兩份清單對得起來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "內政部 is told your ID number and which service asked, every time a proof is made. This hides you from the person checking the proof, not from 內政部.": {
      "comment": "Limitation attached to a zero-knowledge proof",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每產生一次證明，內政部都會知道你的身分證統一編號，以及是哪個服務提出要求。這份證明對查驗的人隱藏了你的身分，對內政部沒有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "內政部 needs this to send the signing request to your phone. It goes to 內政部 and nowhere else, and this app does not keep it — but 內政部 records that you asked, and which service asked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "內政部需要這個號碼才能把簽章請求推送到你的手機。它只會送給內政部，不會送到別的地方，這個 App 也不會保存它——但內政部會留下你提出過要求、以及是哪個服務要求的紀錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "行動自然人憑證 · 本人自簽": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "行動自然人憑證 · 本人自簽"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API record updated": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API 紀錄更新時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arbiscan · Arbitrum One": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arbiscan · Arbitrum One"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blockchain record": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "區塊鏈紀錄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking the blockchain record…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在查核區塊鏈紀錄…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create a zero-knowledge proof": {
      "comment": "ZK proof screen title",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建立零知識證明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Document type": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件類型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download this document from Taiwan's MyData service and keep the original in your on-device data vault.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從台灣 MyData 下載這份文件，並將原始檔保存在裝置上的資料保險箱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each row shows the official API record and independently checks its transaction and current state on Arbitrum. Open a row to inspect both records.": {
      "comment": "trust list evidence explanation",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每一列都會顯示官方 API 紀錄，並獨立查核 Arbitrum 上的交易與合約目前狀態。點開可查看兩邊紀錄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Email address": {
