        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法建立簽章請求"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The verified signature is stored on this phone. Official receiving is still inactive until a government G2C service accepts this app and issues a receiving address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已驗證的簽章保存在這支手機上。在政府 G2C 服務接受此 App 並核發收件地址前，正式收文仍未啟用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app is not connected to the government's G2C exchange service yet. No agency can deliver a legally effective document here today.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 App 尚未連接政府 G2C 交換服務。目前沒有機關能在這裡送達具有法律效力的公文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This sends your ID number, the service identifier, and a prototype-consent digest to the Ministry of the Interior, which keeps a service record. 有備而來 does not save the ID number you type. The signature will not create an official mailbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會把你的身分證統一編號、服務識別碼與試辦同意摘要傳送給內政部，內政部會留下服務紀錄。有備而來不會保存你輸入的統一編號。這次簽章不會建立正式公文匣。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This tests the app-to-app signature only. It does not activate legal electronic delivery.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這只測試 App 間跳轉簽章，不會啟用具有法律效力的電子送達。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for 行動自然人憑證": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待行動自然人憑證"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can test the 行動自然人憑證 signing hand-off now. Official receiving still requires the Archives Administration's G2C exchange service and an agency delivery policy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你現在可以測試行動自然人憑證的簽章跳轉。正式收文仍須接上檔案管理局 G2C 交換服務，並有機關的送達規則。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Development sandbox · No production blockchain record": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開發沙盒 · 沒有正式區塊鏈紀錄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Development sandbox: this entry has no production Arbitrum record and is never trusted by a Release build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開發沙盒：這筆資料沒有正式 Arbitrum 紀錄，Release 版本絕不會信任它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app could not check this issuer's blockchain record, so it did not contact the issuer. Check your connection and try again.": {
      "comment": "gate error: blockchain unavailable",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 無法查核這個發卡者的區塊鏈紀錄，因此沒有連線給發卡者。請檢查網路後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The issuer's official trust-list entry has no blockchain record, so the app did not contact it. Try again after the issuer fixes its registration.": {
      "comment": "gate error: no blockchain anchor",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "發卡者的官方信任清單資料沒有區塊鏈紀錄，因此 App 沒有與它連線。請等發卡者修正登錄後再試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The official trust-list API and blockchain record do not match, so the app did not contact this issuer. Try again later or report the mismatch.": {
      "comment": "gate error: API and chain mismatch",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "官方信任清單 API 與區塊鏈紀錄不相符，因此 App 沒有與這個發卡者連線。請稍後再試，或回報這項不一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
