    },
    "Integrity check failed · repair %@ on this phone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整性檢查未通過・在這支手機上重新建立 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prepare": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "準備"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prepare and verify the checking files before asking someone to send a proof.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請先準備並驗證查驗檔案，再請對方傳送證明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prepare the verification files?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "準備驗證檔案？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preparing verification files…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在準備驗證檔案…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preparing private proof files… %d%%": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在準備隱私證明檔案… %d%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preparing checking files… %d%%": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在準備查驗檔案… %d%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preparing offline checking files…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在準備離線查驗檔案…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking files are not ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查驗檔案尚未備妥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline checking files are ready. The proof returns over Bluetooth; their phone will not show a QR carousel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "離線查驗檔案已備妥。證明會透過藍牙回傳；對方手機不會出現輪替 QR Code。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Repair the verification files?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修復驗證檔案？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The checking keys passed their size and SHA-256 checks and can now be used offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "驗證金鑰已通過檔案大小與 SHA-256 檢查，現在可以離線使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The checking keys passed their size and SHA-256 checks. A proof can now arrive over Bluetooth or as a file, with no network required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "驗證金鑰已通過檔案大小與 SHA-256 檢查。現在可以透過藍牙或檔案接收證明，不需要網路。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloaded files did not pass the installed size and SHA-256 checks, so they will not be used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下載的檔案沒有通過安裝後的大小與 SHA-256 檢查，因此不會使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This downloads %@ of public checking keys and uses about %@ on this phone. The files are pinned in this app and checked before they are installed. Low Data Mode blocks this bulk download.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這會下載 %@ 的公開驗證金鑰，並在這支手機上使用約 %@。檔案的雜湊已固定在 App 內，安裝前會再次檢查。低數據模式會阻擋這項大型下載。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone would not give the app a place to store the verification files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這支手機沒有提供 App 可用來存放驗證檔案的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verification files are not prepared": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "驗證檔案尚未備妥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verification files need repair": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "驗證檔案需要修復"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verification files unavailable": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法使用驗證檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld request(s) may be ready · continue from MyData Personal documents": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可能有 %lld 筆調閱已完成 · 前往 MyData 個人文件繼續"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A PDF downloaded from MyData is not automatically a government-issued VC. The verifier must label the claim as derived and signed by the holder, show the source-file fingerprint and extraction rules, and never display a government-issued badge unless an authority signature was actually verified.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從 MyData 下載的 PDF 不會自動成為政府簽發的 VC。驗證端必須標示這是由持有人衍生並簽署的主張、顯示來源檔案指紋與擷取規則；除非真的驗過機關簽章，絕不能顯示政府簽發標章。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add another file, including one already waiting in MyData Personal documents.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加入另一份文件，也可以接續 MyData 個人文件中已完成的檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any file you can download from MyData can be kept here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只要能從 MyData 下載的文件，都可以保存在這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approve in 行動自然人憑證": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "到行動自然人憑證核准"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Available only while this iPhone is unlocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有這支 iPhone 解鎖時可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before enabling creation, each document type needs a tested parser, stable claim definitions, selective-disclosure signing, and matching verification at verifier.mashbean.net. Export and sharing are available now; credential creation stays gated until those checks exist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "啟用製作功能前，每種文件都要有通過測試的解析器、穩定的主張定義、選擇性揭露簽章，以及 verifier.mashbean.net 對應的驗證。現在已可匯出與分享；這些檢查完成前，憑證製作仍會保持關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Birth date (YYYYMMDD)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出生日期（西元 YYYYMMDD）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bonds is checking the file and keeping the PDF when the archive contains one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有備而來正在檢查檔案；如果壓縮檔內有 PDF，會保存 PDF。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bonds opens the certificate app. Confirm there, then return here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有備而來會開啟行動自然人憑證；請在那裡確認，再回到這裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose an iOS app or person. The exported copy leaves the vault.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選擇 iOS App 或對象；匯出的副本會離開保險箱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "關閉"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete the request in 行動自然人憑證, then come back to Bonds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請在行動自然人憑證完成簽署，再回到有備而來。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue from Personal documents for any downloaded MyData file, or use a shortcut below to request a common document.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
