    "Step 2 of 4 · Approve the signature": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "步驟 2／4 · 核准簽署"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Step 3 of 4 · Back in Bonds": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "步驟 3／4 · 回到有備而來"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Step 4 of 4 · Waiting for MyData": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "步驟 4／4 · 等待 MyData"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored on this iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存在這支 iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taiwan national ID number": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "臺灣身分證統一編號"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The MyData page stays open and continues after the signature.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MyData 頁面會保持開啟，簽署後接續進行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copy you choose to share is no longer protected by this vault. Check the recipient and destination before continuing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你選擇分享的副本將不再受到這個保險箱保護。繼續前請確認收件人與目的地。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original stays in your vault. A future credential should disclose only the answer a verifier needs, not attach this whole document.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原始文件會留在保險箱。未來的憑證應只揭露驗證端需要的答案，不應附上整份文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved ID number and birth date will be removed from this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已儲存的身分證字號與出生日期會從這支 iPhone 移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These details stay in the iOS Keychain on this iPhone. They are filled only on the official mydata.nat.gov.tw site, never sent to Bonds or included in backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些資料只保存在這支 iPhone 的 iOS 鑰匙圈，只會填入官方 mydata.nat.gov.tw 網站，不會傳給有備而來，也不會納入備份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This document may take about %lld minutes. You can leave and later continue from MyData personal documents.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份文件可能需要約 %lld 分鐘。你可以先離開，稍後從 MyData 個人文件繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
